 ⚡️ Situational awareness: The Trump administration is investigating potential J-1 visa fraud at nine top U.S. universities — including Harvard, Stanford, MIT, Yale and Brown — as part of a crackdown on foreign influence in higher ed. The others are Caltech, Pitt, Arizona State and UC Davis. Go deeper . 

 
 
